# The CI image's build context (`tools/ci-image/Dockerfile`, built from the repository root): only what
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` reads. Patterns are relative to the root; later rules win.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!**/package.json
!tools/pnpm
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
repos/**
.nx/**
